I'm pleased to announce two hledger releases!

hledger (https://hledger.org) is accounting software, for both
beginners and experts, using human-readable, version-controllable,
future-proof plain text files.  It's dependable, free, fast, friendly,
cross-platform, double-entry, multi-currency, multi-interface,
GPL-licensed, and fun to use.


hledger 1.52.4 brings packaging updates for the current stable release:

- hledger-web no longer requires yesod-static, and will soon return to stackage
- relaxed aeson lower bound, making it easier to build successfully
- other bounds updates (megaparsec, vty, yesod-core)
- fixes in CSV rules docs and github release install docs

